    "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo Coming Soon</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready for the demo test?\u00a0<br>Really soon we will release the demo version to test the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay updated on our Discord channel.</p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/241551a490b142735bdaa298717f6bee.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo test (2025)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deathmatch (team / 1vs1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personal land mode (private map)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Billboard for custom picture upload</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Social map to interact with other players (vocal and text chat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beta test release (late 2025)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the fixes from players feedback</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival mode (crafting, base building, PvE)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Beta stable release (2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival mode with a huge map and new enemies (and new weapon we hope)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Royal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Car Racing mode</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/64aa8b0b1aba9e2dfa2f980dc53c0734.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div>Neden is a semi-realistic virtual world, with elements of science fiction and magic. A place to socialize, explore, and battle in various modes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your own world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own private space with items acquired in other game modes. Whether your style is a Viking cabin or a mansion with a pool. You can build together with other users in your own private space, you choose who you want to share your world with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/dc64a289372dc7b3e43ba0a036fb2311.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter non-game maps, where you can relax and talk with people from all over the world while discovering new friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create ads to show to other players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/9c23583f70c227acd60d204d2969bd01.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Many game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you prefer to fight or go in search of new items, try out one of these game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Survival <br>Face a lot of monsters equipped with random weapons in this fun mode. Some enemies will be very strong and you will not be able to face them alone: \u200b\u200bwork together with other players and ensure victory. <br>Not all players will be your friends, the PvP mode allows you to attack, defeat and steal materials from your opponents! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Deathmatch <br>1v1 or team maches, choose your favorite weapons set and start the match. Be the first to reach the target before the time limit ends and wipe out your opponents! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/a6fc0af65c28dd98aac08bdd5a211f04.poster.avif?t=1754606127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/a6fc0af65c28dd98aac08bdd5a211f04.webm?t=1754606127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/a6fc0af65c28dd98aac08bdd5a211f04.mp4?t=1754606127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/2f4ad925a5f859962a8f19f7c69c5143.poster.avif?t=1754606127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/2f4ad925a5f859962a8f19f7c69c5143.webm?t=1754606127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/2f4ad925a5f859962a8f19f7c69c5143.mp4?t=1754606127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own character and customize it however you like. Let your personality shine through your avatar, your world and your actions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upcoming modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Car racing, where you can race with various vehicles on many different circuits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completing global missions can unlock new in-game features for all players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to create your own custom textures for character's clothing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/a49dda3239d8cd49dd8e93030e494aff.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/64aa8b0b1aba9e2dfa2f980dc53c0734.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div>Neden is a semi-realistic virtual world, with elements of science fiction and magic. A place to socialize, explore, and battle in various modes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your own world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own private space with items acquired in other game modes. Whether your style is a Viking cabin or a mansion with a pool. You can build together with other users in your own private space, you choose who you want to share your world with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/dc64a289372dc7b3e43ba0a036fb2311.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter non-game maps, where you can relax and talk with people from all over the world while discovering new friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create ads to show to other players! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/9c23583f70c227acd60d204d2969bd01.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Many game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you prefer to fight or go in search of new items, try out one of these game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Survival <br>Face a lot of monsters equipped with random weapons in this fun mode. Some enemies will be very strong and you will not be able to face them alone: \u200b\u200bwork together with other players and ensure victory. <br>Not all players will be your friends, the PvP mode allows you to attack, defeat and steal materials from your opponents! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Deathmatch <br>1v1 or team maches, choose your favorite weapons set and start the match. Be the first to reach the target before the time limit ends and wipe out your opponents! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/a6fc0af65c28dd98aac08bdd5a211f04.poster.avif?t=1754606127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/a6fc0af65c28dd98aac08bdd5a211f04.webm?t=1754606127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/a6fc0af65c28dd98aac08bdd5a211f04.mp4?t=1754606127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/2f4ad925a5f859962a8f19f7c69c5143.poster.avif?t=1754606127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/2f4ad925a5f859962a8f19f7c69c5143.webm?t=1754606127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/2f4ad925a5f859962a8f19f7c69c5143.mp4?t=1754606127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own character and customize it however you like. Let your personality shine through your avatar, your world and your actions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upcoming modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Car racing, where you can race with various vehicles on many different circuits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completing global missions can unlock new in-game features for all players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability to create your own custom textures for character's clothing.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1584240/extras/a49dda3239d8cd49dd8e93030e494aff.avif?t=1754606127\" /></div></p></li></ul>",
